  "explanation": {
    "md_es": "**Imperativo** = verbo en forma base, **sin sujeto**: *Turn left. Wait here. Stop.*\n\n**Negativo:** **Don't** + verbo → *Don't turn left. Don't run.*\n\n**Más educado:** añade *please* → *Please wait here.* o usa *Can you…?* → *Can you help me, please?*\n\n**Excuse me** = para llamar la atención o pasar. **Sorry** = para disculparte.",
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "No turn left.",
        "right": "Don't turn left.",
        "note": "La negativa del imperativo usa Don't."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "You turn left. (como orden)",
        "right": "Turn left.",
        "note": "El imperativo no lleva sujeto."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
